data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/assessment.md\", \"content\": \"Assessment: dev's d002 accepted.\\n\\nVerified independently (not from dev's report alone):\\n- Fetched dev's branch (cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>, commit c5729ad\\n  on top of base 1053761).\\n- Diffed against base: only two new files, src/greet.py and tests/test_greet.py,\\n  matching the spec exactly (no extra CLI/argparse/unrelated files).\\n- src/greet.py: greet(name) returns \\\"Hello, {name}!\\\".\\n- tests/test_greet.py: covers greet(\\\"Alice\\\") and greet(\\\"\\\") (empty string).\\n- Checked out the branch in an isolated worktree and ran\\n  `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` myself: 2 tests, OK, exit 0.\\n\\nAll three mission criteria (src/greet.py, tests/test_greet.py with the two\\nrequired cases, unittest discover exiting 0) are satisfied. Mission is met.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

